
# FortiGate-80F + Cisco L3 Core + L2 Access Switch

## FortiGate-80F

```fortigate
config system interface
    edit "wan1"
        set mode dhcp
        set allowaccess ping
        set role wan
    next
    edit "wan2"
        set mode dhcp
        set allowaccess ping
        set role wan
    next
    edit "FW-TRANSIT"
        set ip 10.255.100.2 255.255.255.252
        set allowaccess ping https
        set interface "internal"
        set vlanid 100
    next
end
```

### Static Routes

```fortigate
config router static
    edit 0
        set dst 192.168.1.0 255.255.255.0
        set gateway 10.255.100.1
        set device "FW-TRANSIT"
    next
    edit 0
        set dst 192.168.2.0 255.255.255.0
        set gateway 10.255.100.1
        set device "FW-TRANSIT"
    next
    edit 0
        set dst 192.168.3.0 255.255.255.0
        set gateway 10.255.100.1
        set device "FW-TRANSIT"
    next
    edit 0
        set dst 192.168.4.0 255.255.255.0
        set gateway 10.255.100.1
        set device "FW-TRANSIT"
    next
end
```

### Firewall Policy

```fortigate
config firewall policy
    edit 0
        set name "LAN-to-Internet"
        set srcintf "FW-TRANSIT"
        set dstintf "wan1"
        set srcaddr "all"
        set dstaddr "all"
        set action accept
        set schedule "always"
        set service "ALL"
        set nat enable
    next
end
```

