### Default Route

```cisco
ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 10.255.100.2
```

### Core-to-FortiGate Trunk

```cisco
interface TenGigabitEthernet1/0/7
 switchport trunk native vlan 999
 switchport trunk allowed vlan 100
 switchport mode trunk
```

